sections.body:
Our artifacts are made available for anonymous review at https:
//doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19336489. We have also uploaded a demon-
stration video of the proof-of-concept exploit to the repository.

The artifacts of Ganadi are publicly available on Zenodo [ 17 ] (https:
//doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21768585) and GitHub (https://github.com/
KIMDONGYEON00/GANADI).

We release the source code, dataset, and experimental results on
our website https://github.com/CombTest/COMBDroid and https:
//doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.31932618.
